    slug: "legal-marketing-software-boost-your-firms-client-intake",
    title: "Legal Marketing Software: Boost Your Firm's Client Intake",
    metaTitle: "Legal Marketing Software for Client Intake",
    excerpt: "How dedicated legal marketing software can meaningfully boost a firm's client intake performance.",
    metaDescription: "How dedicated legal marketing software streamlines client intake, from capturing inquiries to routing them to the right attorney, so fewer leads slip through.",
    category: "Tools & Technology",
    readTime: "7 min read",
